 (arXiv:2605.13772 GeoReason hidden-state transport, the .407 SOTA-ingestion
 method). The TEXT first-error localizer is RETIRED (.407 exp4403: on FoVer
 the content-blind POSITION-ONLY baseline F1=1.0 -- first-error onset is
