 hidden-state both position-bound -- do not revisit). A weak signal is LOGGED
 as a missing-verifier gap (the off-text discriminator), NOT redeployed as a
 headline. verifier_is_oracle=false (a learned probe over hidden states; the
 reference prefix-check defines correctness). Cached corpus; the hidden-state
 capture is a single bounded forward pass; NO live training, NO generator SFT,
 NO TRM training.

